    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i was just looking at those deep field photos from james webb... all those galaxies and just... it makes everything feel so stupid. like, why am i even trying? why does any of this matter if we're just microscopic specks in a void that doesn't even know we exist? it feels like we're just fighting to stay alive for no reason at all.",
