      "content": "exactly. it's crushing. and if the outcome is just nothingness, then why keep fighting the current? why endure all the pain and the struggle just to reach an inevitable, empty end? it feels like we're just prolonging the inevitable for nothing. it would be so much easier to just let go and accept the void instead of pretending that our little struggles have some kind of value.",
